<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>ChatGPT &amp; Codex changelog</title><description>Latest updates to ChatGPT and Codex.</description><link>https://developers.openai.com/</link><atom:link rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" href="https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog/rss.xml"/><item><title>Codex CLI Release: 0.163.0</title><link>https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog/#github-release-414286110</link><guid>https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog/#github-release-414286110</guid><description>0.163.0</description><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Open &lt;code&gt;/config&lt;/code&gt; to search preferences across categories, change supported settings immediately, and see which changes require a restart. (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5795843798&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/52990&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/52990/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/52990&quot;&gt;#52990&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5817657942&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/53429&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/53429/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/53429&quot;&gt;#53429&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Send a follow-up while Codex is responding to steer it immediately. Interrupting a turn also stops active Code Mode cells and their nested tool calls. (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5750826099&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/51812&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/51812/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/51812&quot;&gt;#51812&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5752144952&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/51835&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/51835/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/51835&quot;&gt;#51835&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Configure a leader key in &lt;code&gt;/keymap&lt;/code&gt;. The default is &lt;code&gt;Ctrl+X&lt;/code&gt;, shortcut hints stay open until you choose or cancel, and voice mute moves to &lt;code&gt;F9&lt;/code&gt;. (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5768843681&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/52273&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/52273/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/52273&quot;&gt;#52273&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>GPT-5.5 retirement in Codex</title><link>https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog/#codex-2026-10-14-gpt-55-retirement</link><guid>https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog/#codex-2026-10-14-gpt-55-retirement</guid><description>GPT-5.5 retirement in Codex</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded></content:encoded></item><item><title>Codex CLI Release: 0.162.1</title><link>https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog/#github-release-408271623</link><guid>https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog/#github-release-408271623</guid><description>0.162.1</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fixed a TUI crash when asynchronous questions contain multiple lines, preserving line breaks and complete hyperlink destinations. (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5753050054&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/51866&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/51866/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/51866&quot;&gt;#51866&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fixed startup failures caused by differences between a running background server&apos;s feature settings and CLI defaults. Compatibility checks now apply only to explicit command-line feature overrides. (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5781941385&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/52648&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/52648/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/52648&quot;&gt;#52648&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title>GPT-5.5 retires from ChatGPT, ChatGPT Work, and Codex on October 14</title><link>https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog/#codex-2026-09-14-gpt-55-retirement</link><guid>https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog/#codex-2026-09-14-gpt-55-retirement</guid><description>GPT-5.5 retires from ChatGPT, ChatGPT Work, and Codex on October 14</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded></content:encoded></item></channel></rss>
